ii. Course Introduction

This course- CpE Elective 3 is a course focused on the integration of Software Engineering and Artificial Intelligence (AI). 
It explores how AI technologies can be applied to software development, particularly in designing and developing intelligent systems that can perform tasks, 
make decisions, and solve problems. The course provides an opportunity to understand the relationship between traditional software engineering principles 
and emerging AI technologies. It also introduces the concepts and applications of AI agents and how they can contribute to making software systems more 
intelligent, adaptive, and efficient. Through this course, I aim to gain both theoretical knowledge and practical experience in applying software engineering 
concepts and AI tools to develop solutions for real-world problems.
